reate a minitel application this is a telecom application with backend in spring boot microservices with user services have endpoints as login register update and view profile, sim service has view sim, buy a plan, delete sim, get sims of a user then I have plan service in which you can view plan and admin can add plan , update plan , delete plan, then I have bill service for generating monthly bills, previous bills, bill by simid, then I have a sim-request service where admin can view pending requests, approve requests and user can see its requests
